HakiOS — A03s port

Two licenses apply:

1. The A03s changes to Apple's XNU are **not redistributed in this repository**;
   `kernel/README.md` only describes them. If you reproduce them, they are a
   derivative work of Apple's XNU and are licensed under the Apple Public Source
   License, Version 2.0, whose full text is in LICENSE.APSL. Apple's notices must
   be kept in the files they belong to.

2. Everything else that is ours (the boot loader in `loader/`, the user-space
   code in `userland/src/`, the UEFI port, the tools, the scripts, the
   documentation) is licensed under the MIT License below.

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in NOTICE. iOS, the iOS 16.5 IPSW, Apple's
trademarks and the phone's own firmware are not part of this repository and are not licensed by
it; every user obtains them from their own device and their own copy of the firmware.

